 "cell_contents": "Four O4-normalized formula units, equivalently 4/3 NaMg2Al5SiO12 units, per conventional primitive orthorhombic Pbnm cell. Kawai and Tsuchiya used a 1x1x3 supercell containing 84 atoms, hence three 28-atom conventional cells. The stored crystallographic model is an explicitly identified NaAlSiO4 topology proxy and does not represent the calculated Mg-bearing cation ordering.",
 "units": {"pressure": "GPa", "temperature": "K", "volume": "angstrom^3/conventional_unit_cell"},
 "symmetry": "ORTHORHOMBIC",
 "lattice": {"a": 10.1182, "b": 8.679, "c": 2.7363, "alpha": 90.0, "beta": 90.0, "gamma": 90.0},
 "formula_units_per_cell": 1.3333333333333333,
 "space_group": "Pbnm",
 "space_group_number": 62,
