 "notes": "The lattice, coordinates, elements, and occupancies are transcribed without modification from Qin et al.'s deposited ideal NaAlSiO4 refinement and are present only as an isostructural topology proxy. They are not NaMg2Al5SiO12 coordinates and do not encode any of Kawai and Tsuchiya's twelve ordered supercells. No Mg substitution, Al/Si partition, or target occupancy is inferred. The executable EOS V0, rather than this 1.7 GPa proxy lattice, defines the target phase's zero-pressure volume.",
